/// - [`Review`](InteractionMode::Review) - 浠ｇ爜瀹℃煡妯″紡锛孉I 锟?diff 杩涜璇勫
/// - [`Task`](InteractionMode::Task) - 涓€娆℃€т换鍔℃ā寮忥紝绫讳技 Work 鍩熺殑 Skill 鎵ц
#[derive(Debug, Clone, Serialize, PartialEq, Eq, Hash)]
